hi I'm Evan Carmichael welcome to the  diction of ask Evan in today's episode  I'm going to answer a question from one  of my newsletter readers hopes and who  wants to start a business but isn't sure  what businesses start and what it might  bice on how to get started so hopes and  thanks for the question I think it's a  lot there's a lot of people who go  through that same thing and trying to  figure out what business do I want to  start the most important thing I think  you could do is follow a business path  that you're really passionate about and  you think you can have a significant  impact on so if you look at all the  famous entrepreneurs and how they got  started they always talk about not the  money that they're going after but the  impact that they hope to have they have  a vision of the world that they want to  see and they can make that happen they  think they can help a lot of people so  providing value and helping people is at  the core of every successful business so  what is it that you're really excited  about you're really interested in and  you think you can really help people  with and then how can you build a  business around that so look at things  that you're passionate about look at  things that are your hobbies think about  things that you do for free anyway to  help other people and is there a way to  turn that into a business or not for me  for example I love helping entrepreneurs  and I do a lot of work helping  entrepreneurs and and I make these  videos helping entrepreneurs most of the  stuff that I do even these videos I  don't get paid to make these videos it's  I love helping entrepreneurs and and the  making these videos is something that I  love doing I look forward to every week  when I'm making these videos putting  them together now some of them i do get  paid for that might be sponsored but  most of the stuff that I do building up  the content you know is is free and I do  because I really love doing it and I've  been able to 